abstract: >-
  The White Rabbit Methodology is an independent cybersecurity practitioner
  methodology built around the continuous operational cycle KNOW IT, BUILD IT,
  BREAK IT, DETECT IT, FIX IT, and PROVE IT. It approaches offensive and
  defensive security as complementary views of the same system and uses
  MITRE ATT&CK as a foundational framework for connecting adversary behavior
  with defensive visibility, detection, mitigation, remediation, and validation.

